ging to life the 10,000 plus  characters that Marvel fully controls is  what the game plan is Marvel's Netflix  heroes if you're hoping to see the cast  of Netflix as defenders or Punisher and  Avengers 4 you should probably go ahead  and feel the disappointment now in March  2018 Joe Russo told premiere the Netflix  heroes were considered for inclusion in  Avengers infinity war but it would have  been too much to juggle especially with  so many different directors involved the  trick is that we already have at least  60 characters with whom we must tell a  story and it's hard enough to  communicate with Taika Waititi ryan  coogler scott derrickson Peyton Reed and  James Gunn at the same time not to add  all the showrunners and TV crews to this  so it's practically impossible our job  is to focus on the Marvel film world and  offer a satisfying climax of course in  the interview Russo was talking  specifically about infinity war not  Avengers 4 but it's safe to assume it  applies to Avengers 4 as well Silver  Surfer before the release of Avengers  infinity war rumors flew around the web  that Silver Surfer would make a surprise  appearance in the film spoilers he  didn't and while the rumor mill is just  getting started when it comes to  Avengers 4 you probably shouldn't  believe any reports you hear about  Silver Surfer making a cameo in it  like the x-men and the Fantastic Four  the rights to Silver Surfer are held up  in the Disney Foxx acquisition even if  that gets resolved before  Avengers 4 comes out expect Silver  Surfer to make his debut later rather  than sooner Deadpool as soon as Disney's  attempt to acquire Fox was announced  deadpool star ryan reynolds trolled the  mouse house by retweeting a picture of  deadpool bean escorted out of disneyland  later after the success of Avengers  infinity war Reynolds tweeted  congratulations to the team by posting  what he said was his Avengers rejection  letter from Tony Stark  hey given what happened to his last t